# 4jawaly Integration Rules (Cline)

نفس قواعد Cursor. راجع `cursor/.cursorrules` أو `.claude/skills/` للتفاصيل الكاملة.

## Quick Reference

**Auth**: `Authorization: Basic base64(JAWALY_API_KEY:JAWALY_API_SECRET)`

**SMS** (base `https://api-sms.4jawaly.com/api/v1`):
- `POST /account/area/sms/send` — `{"messages":[{"text","numbers":[],"sender"}]}`
- `GET /account/area/me/balances`
- `GET /account/area/me/senders?status=1`

**WhatsApp** (`POST https://api-users.4jawaly.com/api/v1/whatsapp/591`):
- `path:"message/text"` → text
- `path:"message/file"` → image/video/audio/document
- `path:"message/location"` → location
- `path:"message/link"` → link preview
- `path:"message/contact"` → contact card
- `path:"message/template"` → Meta template
- `path:"global"` → interactive (buttons/list)

**Constraints**: phone international without `+`; HTTPS media only; interactive needs 24h window; templates work anytime.
